{"id":"629263","name":"蘸水手撕鸡脯肉","author":"小洞天","authorId":"126119","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/629263/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡脯肉","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"熟白芝麻","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡脯肉冷水下锅，开锅后撇去浮沫。","img":"images/629263/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入葱、姜、白酒，小火煮30分钟左右。","img":"images/629263/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放凉后撕成细丝，码入盘中。","img":"images/629263/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"取一蘸碟，放入蒜蓉、辣椒面。","img":"images/629263/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入芝麻。","img":"images/629263/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入盐。","img":"images/629263/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入葱花，浇上热油。","img":"images/629263/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入适量生抽。","img":"images/629263/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"少许白糖。","img":"images/629263/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"少许味精。","img":"images/629263/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/629263/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"蘸食。","img":"images/629263/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"1.鸡脯肉小火煮30分钟，充分煮熟，不能夹生。\n2.油温要高，炝出蒜香、芝麻香和红油。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}